  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>GOLDEN, Colorado—The Drake Law Firm, a full-service law firm operating out of Golden, Colorado, recently attended a breakfast fundraiser organized by Court Support Jeffco. The event, held on June 8, featured Colorado Supreme Court Chief Justice Boatright as a keynote speaker. The fundraiser’s goal was to further the cause of providing financial assistance to Problem Solving Courts in Jefferson County. The team at The Drake Law Firm knows firsthand the invaluable importance of Problem Solving Courts in Colorado, which is why they have donated generously to this worthy cause. They hope their contribution will allow Court Support Jeffco to continue expanding its mission to “support recovery, community safety, and stable families.”</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5678 \" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-2.jpg\" alt=\"The Drake Law Firm Attends Partners in Recovery Breakfast Fundraiser - 2\" width=\"1244\" height=\"933\" srcset=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-2.jpg 2272w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-2-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-2-768x576.jpg 768w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-2-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-2-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1244px) 100vw, 1244px\" /></p>\n<p>“The Drake Law Firm believes in supporting worthy causes in our community,” says Marie Drake, Attorney and CEO of The Drake Law Firm, P.C. “I’m excited to donate $250.00 to Court Support Jeffco today to assist them in building stronger and more stable communities by addressing the root causes of crime. When mental health and addiction play a role, it affects the family and the community. In these cases, helping the individual recover is vital in restoring family stability and reducing the chances of recidivism. It creates a win for everyone, including taxpayers. I look forward to contributing to their ongoing success.”</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5679 aligncenter\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-3-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"The Drake Law Firm Attends Partners in Recovery Breakfast Fundraiser - 3\" width=\"1243\" height=\"932\" srcset=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-3-300x225.jpg 300w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-3-768x576.jpg 768w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/The-Drake-Law-Firm-Attends-Partners-in-Recovery-Breakfast-Fundraiser-3.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1243px) 100vw, 1243px\" /></p>\n<h2>About The Drake Law Firm</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/\">The Drake Law Firm, P.C.</a> is a full-service law firm with offices in Golden and Colorado, which focuses primarily on family law, divorce, child custody, and child support. The Drake Law Firm also offers services in real estate law and business law. Originally founded in 2011, it has provided countless clients in Colorado and the entire Rocky Mountains region with solution-oriented legal representation for over a decade. The Drake Law Firm prides itself on taking a proactive approach to their clients’ cases and has made it a part of its core mission to give undivided, individualized attention to every client according to their needs. Take advantage of a free, 15-minute consultation by calling <a href=\"tel:303-261-8111\">(303) 261-8111</a> or filling out the online <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">contact form</a>.</p>\n<h2>About Court Support Jeffco</h2>\n<p>Court Support Jeffco is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization that supports Problem Solving Courts in the 1st Judicial District as well as several municipal courts in the city of Lakewood.</p>\n<p>These Problem Solving Courts were all started with the goals of improving outcomes, lowering taxpayer costs, and stopping the revolving door of the court system for participants and their families.</p>\n<p>Court Support Jeffco supports recovery, community safety, and stable families. Substance use and dependency as well as mental health impact us all, either personally or through family and friends. These programs offer participants the opportunity to change their lives and their families.</p>\n"
  },
